    "plainText": "PDF features\nThis category documents local PDF preparation for annual personal tax returns.\nArticles\nCRA mail-in PDF package — supported 2025 Ontario forms, local assembly, unsupported situations, attachments, privacy boundaries, and official sources.\nMandatory manual review — the fail-closed state machine that controls local export and printing.\nScope\nThe current repository foundation does not provide a user interface, a concrete PDF adapter, verified physical PDF field profiles, a built application, or a released artifact. The package defines the bounded preparation contracts for those later components.\nNo feature in this category files a return. NETFILE, EFILE, electronic submission, direct CRA transmission, simulated filing, and automatic filing are prohibited.",
